{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1508836-how-this-is-even-possible","id":1508836,"title":"How this is even possible?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-18T22:16:03-07:00","id":1508836,"title":"How this is even possible?","content":"I don't know if it's a good idea to ask this, but it kind of stuck in my head so I'm going to ask anyway. A friend wanted to invite me to his campaign and in the middle of the conversation he told me about the pack that is composed of (and this is not a joke) 3 Garou, including a Ronin; a Gurahl; a dhampir; 2 mages, one with cybernetic implants and the other Hollow; a kinfolk and a psychic (I don't even know if this is in the game) and they even seem to have a totem too, so someone answer me, what set of circumstances would make this group to be formed. I know this is ridiculous, but somehow this is bothering me and I can't explain why.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-18T23:13:52-07:00","id":1508840,"title":"","content":"I can't speak to what might have gathered such a group together, but there's enough hand-waving of the rules and lore of the games I'm not sure it really matters. Some people just like going gonzo off the walls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-19T06:34:54-07:00","id":1508880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1508836-how-this-is-even-possible?p=1508840#post1508840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't speak to what might have gathered such a group together, but there's enough hand-waving of the rules and lore of the games I'm not sure it really matters. Some people just like going gonzo off the walls.</div> </div> </div> </div>What's Gonzo?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-19T08:26:20-07:00","id":1508891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1508836-how-this-is-even-possible?p=1508880#post1508880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What's Gonzo?</div> </div> </div> </div>Over the top, without measure. The term started out with a highly personal, witty and rude form of Journalism, but it moved on to mean other things. The use of WoD in this way without any restraints or a semblance of structure is probably closest to Gonzo pornography.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":1182,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","user":"Asmodai","date":".  Words can be hard. 04-19-2023, 11:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-19T12:30:39-07:00","id":1508914,"title":"","content":"It is quite a wild scenario, and the conditions necessary to put it together would be extreme. But it is conceivable.<br /> <br /> But before explaining the situation, you need to understand the situation. The first question here is probably how literal/in what sense terms like &quot;Pack&quot; and &quot;Totem&quot; are being used here. It could be that the group is being informally called a &quot;pack&quot; because it's a term familiar to the Shifters among them, while the Totem in question might simply belong to one of the Mages. A contrived scenario, but it demonstrates the need to be specific with these things.<br /> <br /> But assuming that we are assuming a 'traditional' Pack with a Totem binding all the members listed above together, then that Totem is probably going to be the most important factor. That Totem is presumably agreeing to all of this of its own free will, why? I'm not enough of an expert to say for certain, but I'm assuming that it's bending or breaking all sorts of rules in the ancient pacts between the spirits and the Garou. Is the spirit itself just unusual, the kind that isn't going to care about that sort of thing? Or are the circumstances so dire that tradition needs to go out the window in favour of need?<br /> <br /> Depending on the nature of the relationship with the Totem spirit, there may also be some important questions about the Ronin. If the group is the consequence of responding to an epic-scale emergency, you could potentially see some Garou from the Nation overlooking the rules around Ronin if the order comes from a high-ranking spirit lord. But otherwise the Ronin is probably keeping their status to themselves. If they aren't, then the Garou from the Nation are running the risk of becoming Ronin as well.<br /> <br /> The Shifters might also not be a fan of a techno-Mage, seeing them as Weaver-tainted, above and beyond the general distrust of Mages.<br /> <br /> But again, it's possible to create the circumstances necessary to justify nearly any scenario. It's just a question of trying to avoid being egregiously contrived.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-19T13:34:01-07:00","id":1508923,"title":"","content":"I don't know about the concept of pack in this case, if it's literal or not, now the totem I remember he had I just don't know what it is, I was so bewildered when he explained it to me that I didn't even bother to ask.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-22T19:55:14-07:00","id":1509342,"title":"","content":"Nothing makes that grouo impossible. All that matters is the justification of such an alliance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-22T20:47:20-07:00","id":1509346,"title":"","content":"Yeah; stranger combinations have happened; like said above; is there justification for such an alliance?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-22T22:42:30-07:00","id":1509350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1508836-how-this-is-even-possible?p=1509346#post1509346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah; stranger combinations have happened; like said above; is there justification for such an alliance?</div> </div> </div> </div>In fact I was so &quot;bothered&quot; by this that I went to ask my friend what adventure they were doing and apparently they are doing a kind of resistance field against, I have no idea what it is, but at this point I even suppose that be aliens, and in this field brings together beings of all races and they even invented putting the rebbot creatures in the middle, they just cut out the ghosts. And I thought this couldn't get &quot;better&quot; to put it mildly. Am I supposed to laugh or cry? because I'm doing both now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-23T17:55:47-07:00","id":1512512,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1508836-how-this-is-even-possible?p=1509350#post1509350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In fact I was so &quot;bothered&quot; by this that I went to ask my friend what adventure they were doing and apparently they are doing a kind of resistance field against, I have no idea what it is, but at this point I even suppose that be aliens, and in this field brings together beings of all races and they even invented putting the rebbot creatures in the middle, they just cut out the ghosts. And I thought this couldn't get &quot;better&quot; to put it mildly. Am I supposed to laugh or cry? because I'm doing both now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Back in the day, we had to struggle to find ways all the types of characters the players wanted to play into the game. <br /> <br /> All my friends played V:tM one summer, but, I had little interests in vampires until I read Ann Rice in the fall, so, I played a Lupine. Then, I played a Corax; then, an Antedulivian, until I got Mummy 2e, and settled on a Mummy because I wanted to play an ancient-character. By that time, the game changed from V;tM to WoD, and one player was a Mage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}